OL,3,AOpenAI agents get rebrand - as 'dots' -
OL,4,Awhile safety worries delay new model
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI has given a new name its updated
OL,7,Fversions of artificial intelligence
OL,8,Ftools which are widely known as agents,
OL,9,Fcalling them "dots" instead
OL,11,FChief executive Sam Altman referred to
OL,12,F"dots" as "remarkably capable,
OL,13,Falways-on agents that can handle really
OL,14,Fanything you can think of."
OL,16,FOpenAI in recent months has come under
OL,17,Fintense scrutiny as internal tests of
OL,18,Fits AI agents have revealed often
OL,19,Funexpected and occasionally harmful
OL,20,Factions, leading to more public and
OL,21,Fgovernment fears.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
