OL,3,AOpenAI scraps rollout of new model over
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI has announced it will not
OL,7,Frelease its latest AI model due to
OL,8,Fsafety concerns.
OL,10,FIts GPT-6.1 Astra system, which
OL,11,Fperforms tasks like browsing the web
OL,12,Fand using apps by itself, "didn't quite
OL,13,Fmeet the bar" of the company's
OL,14,Fstandards, according to Saachi Jain,
OL,15,Fhead of safety systems at OpenAI.
OL,17,FThe ChatGPT-maker also issued an update
OL,18,Fon incidents that occurred in June but
OL,19,Fwere not made public until last week,
OL,20,Fwhere its models accessed Australian
OL,21,Fgovernment websites and systems without
OL,22,Fauthorisation.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
